\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.17}{\ignorespaces Pitch-angle time histories (angles measured from the horizontal plane). The AG25-equipped vehicle (Wing~2) reaches a minimum pitch angle of approximately \SI {15}{\degree }, while the NACA~0015 baseline (Wing~1) reaches a minimum of approximately \SI {36}{\degree }. These extrema indicate that Wing~2 can sustain lift at much lower nose-up attitudes.\relax }}{46}{figure.caption.58}\protected@file@percent }
